{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117537","id":3411743928,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LWxS4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117537","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117537.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117537.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117537","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117537/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117537/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117537/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bb61cc3f8eb03a28235ca75c5f0eb853bb367be7","number":117537,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Remove unnecessary Vulkan swap chain formats.","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nNone that I'm aware of. This is only code cleanup.\r\n\r\n### Does this PR include any additional changes beyond those required to solve these problems?\r\n\r\nNo.\r\n\r\n### What is the rationale for the approach used in this PR?\r\n\r\nThese swap chain formats were introduced by #94496. When that PR was first written, it allowed support of 10-bit swap chain formats for the purpose of HDR10 (PQ-encoded) swap chain buffers. These were eventually removed from the PR, but the swap chain formats were left in either accidentally or for use by other PRs like Android.\r\n\r\n### Was AI used to create a portion of this PR?\r\n\r\nNo.\r\n\r\n### Are there any parts of this PR that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers?\r\n\r\n#101977 currently makes use of these swap chain formats to support HDR via HDR10 encoding. I expect the Android PR to be updated to no longer use these formats. I'm leaving this PR as a draft until Android HDR output is merged, which will give us information on whether these swap chain formats will ever be needed.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoten